{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in the loss of a family unit which the Council considers to be suitable for continued residential use in order to help meet the demand for such accommodation in the borough. Thus it is contrary to NPPF, London Plan policies H1, H8, H9 and Local Plan policies SC1, SC3. ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal has failed to demonstrate how the proposed development will avoid any adverse impact on the amenity of neighbouring residents due to the increased activity with comings and goings leading to greater noise and disturbances within the building and neighbourhood. In addition, the site is not suitable to provide accommodation for up to four people as suggested as the bedroom sizes and unit area are not in compliance with NDSS. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2, ED3, EQ5, SC5, London Plan policies E10, D5, D6 and NPPF. ",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal has failed to consider flood risk impacts arising through the proposed change of use and, in particular, has failed to demonstrate that flood risk has been considered at the design stages of the proposal, contrary to Local Plan Policy EQ3 and the National Planning Policy Framework."
  ],
